  triage:title "bb5-assignment evidence has no explicit atm --version / doctor-version capture proving the container binary is 1.5.17" ;
  triage:description "req-qa, independently confirmed by quality-mgr, BB-EVIDENCE-QA-1789287034 (PR #1483, report 2026-09-13T11:10:00Z). bb5-assignment evidence has no explicit atm --version / doctor-version-field capture proving the container binary is 1.5.17, unlike bb4 (bb4-task-start.json:492-498, direct atm --version output) and bb6 (bb6-prompt-handoffs.json:311-313, doctor client_context/daemon_context version field). bb5's 1.5.17 identity is only implied by the image tag string." ;
